      "paperId": "2cd22dbdc168c919b5a969c90c046cb6f6f3eeaa",
      "title": "Spectres of Marx in the Lacanian Left: Between Melancholia and Mourning of Marxism",
      "authors": [
        {
          "name": "David Pav\u00f3n\u2010Cu\u00e9llar",
          "authorId": "2073954062"
